<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets China Petrochem warrants.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets China Petrochem warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Friday it issued 10 million American-style call warrants on shares of China Petrochemical Development Corp.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   T$39.899	PREMIUM	  12.15 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE    T$9.82	  GEARING	  4.51X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION     20.FEB.98     BOARD LOT	10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	  LUXEMBOURG    PAY DATE	 10.MAR.97</p>
<p> SPOT PRICE     T$44.3322     LISTING DATE   TO BE DETERMINED</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
